<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Rules</h1>
<p>Valhalla is a game, and it's meant to be fun, for everyone. So there is 
really only one rule: play the game, and help make the world a fun place 
for everybody.
</p><p>If you persistently harass other players, or spoil the game for them, 
the gods will have to do something about it.
</p><p>You may play more than one character at a time, and use aliases, 
triggers, scripts and bots (see <a cmd='#'>Help Botting</a>), as long as nobody's fun 
is spoiled by it. Fighting other players is only for those who have 
signed the Book of Blood (see <a cmd='#'>Help Book of Blood</a>).
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Botting</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Book of Blood</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Player Etiquette</a>
</pre>




</div>